<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="es">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>ReservasBot — El asistente inteligente para tu restaurante</title>
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@300;400;500;600;700;800;900&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
  <style>
    *, *::before, *::after { margin: 0; padding: 0; box-sizing: border-box; }

    :root {
      --bg: #030308;
      --glass: rgba(255,255,255,0.032);
      --glass-h: rgba(255,255,255,0.055);
      --gb: rgba(255,255,255,0.07);
      --t: rgba(255,255,255,0.92);
      --t2: rgba(255,255,255,0.45);
      --t3: rgba(255,255,255,0.18);
      --acc: #8b5cf6;
      --acc2: #6366f1;
    }

    html { scroll-behavior: smooth; }
    body {
      font-family: 'Inter', -apple-system, sans-serif;
      background: var(--bg); color: var(--t);
      -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;
      overflow-x: hidden;
    }

    /* ── ORBS ── */
    .orb {
      position: fixed; border-radius: 50%;
      filter: blur(140px); pointer-events: none; z-index: 0; will-change: transform;
    }
    .orb-1 { width: 900px; height: 900px; background: radial-gradient(circle, rgba(124,58,237,0.12) 0%, transparent 70%); top: -300px; left: -200px; animation: d1 26s ease-in-out infinite; }
    .orb-2 { width: 700px; height: 700px; background: radial-gradient(circle, rgba(79,70,229,0.09) 0%, transparent 70%); top: 30%; right: -200px; animation: d2 32s ease-in-out infinite; }
    .orb-3 { width: 500px; height: 500px; background: radial-gradient(circle, rgba(167,139,250,0.07) 0%, transparent 70%); bottom: 10%; left: 20%; animation: d3 20s ease-in-out infinite; }
    @keyframes d1 { 0%,100%{transform:translate(0,0)} 33%{transform:translate(60px,50px)} 66%{transform:translate(-30px,80px)} }
    @keyframes d2 { 0%,100%{transform:translate(0,0)} 50%{transform:translate(-60px,-40px)} }
    @keyframes d3 { 0%,100%{transform:translate(0,0)} 50%{transform:translate(40px,-60px)} }

    /* ── NAV ── */
    nav {
      position: fixed; top: 0; left: 0; right: 0; z-index: 200;
      display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center;
      padding: 0 60px; height: 64px;
      background: rgba(3,3,8,0.7);
      backdrop-filter: blur(40px); -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(40px);
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--gb);
    }
    .nav-brand { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px; text-decoration: none; }
    .nav-mark {
      width: 32px; height: 32px; background: linear-gradient(135deg, #8b5cf6, #6366f1);
      border-radius: 9px; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
      font-size: 15px; box-shadow: 0 4px 16px rgba(139,92,246,0.5);
    }
    .nav-name { font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: -0.4px; color: #fff; }
    .nav-links { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 36px; }
    .nav-links a { font-size: 13px; font-weight: 500; color: var(--t2); text-decoration: none; transition: color 0.2s; }
    .nav-links a:hover { color: var(--t); }
    .nav-actions { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px; }
    .btn-ghost-sm {
      padding: 8px 16px; border-radius: 10px; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 600;
      color: var(--t2); text-decoration: none; border: 1px solid var(--gb);
      background: var(--glass); transition: all 0.2s;
    }
    .btn-ghost-sm:hover { color: var(--t); border-color: rgba(255,255,255,0.12); background: var(--glass-h); }
    .btn-accent-sm {
      padding: 8px 18px; border-radius: 10px; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 700;
      color: #fff; text-decoration: none;
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, #8b5cf6, #6366f1);
      box-shadow: 0 4px 16px rgba(139,92,246,0.4);
      transition: all 0.2s;
    }
    .btn-accent-sm:hover { box-shadow: 0 6px 24px rgba(139,92,246,0.6); transform: translateY(-1px); }

    /* ── SECTIONS ── */
    section { position: relative; z-index: 1; }

    /* ── HERO ── */
    .hero {
      min-height: 100vh; display: flex; flex-direction: column;
      align-items: center; justify-content: center;
      padding: 120px 40px 80px; text-align: center;
    }
    .hero-badge {
      display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 7px;
      background: rgba(139,92,246,0.1); border: 1px solid rgba(139,92,246,0.3);
      border-radius: 20px; padding: 6px 16px; margin-bottom: 28px;
      font-size: 12px; font-weight: 600; color: #c4b5fd; letter-spacing: 0.5px;
    }
    .hero-badge-dot { width: 6px; height: 6px; border-radius: 50%; background: #8b5cf6; box-shadow: 0 0 8px #8b5cf6; animation: glow 2s ease-in-out infinite; }
    @keyframes glow { 0%,100%{box-shadow:0 0 4px #8b5cf6} 50%{box-shadow:0 0 14px #8b5cf6} }

    .hero h1 {
      font-size: clamp(44px, 7vw, 80px); font-weight: 900; letter-spacing: -3px;
      line-height: 1.02; margin-bottom: 22px; max-width: 820px;
    }
    .hero h1 em {
      font-style: normal;
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, #c4b5fd 20%, #818cf8 60%, #6366f1 100%);
      -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent; background-clip: text;
    }
    .hero-sub {
      font-size: 18px; color: var(--t2); max-width: 540px; line-height: 1.65;
      margin-bottom: 40px; font-weight: 400;
    }
    .hero-btns { display: flex; gap: 12px; justify-content: center; flex-wrap: wrap; }
    .btn-hero-primary {
      padding: 15px 36px; border-radius: 14px; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 700;
      color: #fff; text-decoration: none; letter-spacing: -0.3px;
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, #8b5cf6, #6366f1);
      box-shadow: 0 8px 32px rgba(139,92,246,0.45);
      transition: all 0.25s cubic-bezier(0.4,0,0.2,1);
    }
    .btn-hero-primary:hover { box-shadow: 0 12px 48px rgba(139,92,246,0.65); transform: translateY(-2px); }
    .btn-hero-secondary {
      padding: 15px 32px; border-radius: 14px; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600;
      color: var(--t2); text-decoration: none; background: var(--glass);
      border: 1px solid var(--gb); transition: all 0.2s;
    }
    .btn-hero-secondary:hover { color: var(--t); border-color: rgba(255,255,255,0.12); background: var(--glass-h); }

    /* ── SOCIAL PROOF ── */
    .proof-bar {
      margin-top: 60px; padding: 0 40px 80px;
      display: flex; justify-content: center; gap: 10px; flex-wrap: wrap;
    }
    .proof-stat {
      background: var(--glass); border: 1px solid var(--gb);
      border-radius: 16px; padding: 20px 32px; text-align: center;
      backdrop-filter: blur(20px); -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(20px);
      min-width: 140px;
    }
    .proof-num {
      font-size: 32px; font-weight: 800; letter-spacing: -1px;
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, #c4b5fd, #818cf8);
      -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent; background-clip: text;
    }
    .proof-lbl { font-size: 12px; color: var(--t3); margin-top: 4px; font-weight: 500; }

    /* ── COMO FUNCIONA ── */
    .how {
      padding: 100px 40px; max-width: 1100px; margin: 0 auto;
    }
    .section-tag {
      display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 6px;
      background: rgba(139,92,246,0.1); border: 1px solid rgba(139,92,246,0.2);
      border-radius: 20px; padding: 4px 14px;
      font-size: 11px; font-weight: 700; color: #c4b5fd; letter-spacing: 1px; text-transform: uppercase;
      margin-bottom: 16px;
    }
    .section-title {
      font-size: clamp(32px, 4vw, 46px); font-weight: 800; letter-spacing: -1.5px;
      line-height: 1.1; margin-bottom: 14px;
    }
    .section-title em { font-style:normal; background:linear-gradient(135deg,#c4b5fd,#818cf8); -webkit-background-clip:text; -webkit-text-fill-color:transparent; background-clip:text; }
    .section-sub { font-size: 16px; color: var(--t2); margin-bottom: 56px; max-width: 500px; line-height: 1.6; }

    .steps-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); gap: 20px; }
    .step-card {
      background: var(--glass); border: 1px solid var(--gb); border-radius: 20px;
      padding: 36px 28px; backdrop-filter: blur(20px); -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(20px);
      transition: all 0.3s cubic-bezier(0.4,0,0.2,1); position: relative; overflow: hidden;
    }
    .step-card::before {
      content: ''; position: absolute; inset: 0; opacity: 0;
      background: radial-gradient(ellipse at 30% 0%, rgba(139,92,246,0.08) 0%, transparent 70%);
      transition: opacity 0.3s;
    }
    .step-card:hover { border-color: rgba(139,92,246,0.35); transform: translateY(-4px); box-shadow: 0 24px 60px rgba(0,0,0,0.4), 0 0 80px rgba(139,92,246,0.06); }
    .step-card:hover::before { opacity: 1; }
    .step-num {
      width: 44px; height: 44px; border-radius: 14px; margin-bottom: 22px;
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(139,92,246,0.2), rgba(99,102,241,0.2));
      border: 1px solid rgba(139,92,246,0.3);
      display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
      font-size: 18px; font-weight: 800; color: #c4b5fd;
    }
    .step-title { font-size: 18px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: -0.4px; margin-bottom: 10px; }
    .step-desc { font-size: 14px; color: var(--t2); line-height: 1.65; }

    /* ── FEATURES ── */
    .features-section { padding: 100px 40px; }
    .features-section .inner { max-width: 1100px; margin: 0 auto; }
    .features-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); gap: 16px; }
    .feat-card {
      background: var(--glass); border: 1px solid var(--gb); border-radius: 18px;
      padding: 28px; backdrop-filter: blur(20px); -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(20px);
      transition: all 0.3s cubic-bezier(0.4,0,0.2,1);
    }
    .feat-card:hover { border-color: rgba(139,92,246,0.3); transform: translateY(-2px); box-shadow: 0 16px 48px rgba(0,0,0,0.3); }
    .feat-icon {
      width: 44px; height: 44px; border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 18px;
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(139,92,246,0.15), rgba(99,102,241,0.15));
      border: 1px solid rgba(139,92,246,0.2);
      display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; font-size: 20px;
    }
    .feat-title { font-size: 15px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: -0.3px; margin-bottom: 8px; }
    .feat-desc { font-size: 13px; color: var(--t2); line-height: 1.65; }

    /* ── PRICING ── */
    .pricing-section { padding: 100px 40px; }
    .pricing-section .inner { max-width: 1000px; margin: 0 auto; }
    .plans { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); gap: 20px; margin-top: 56px; }
    .plan {
      background: var(--glass); border: 1px solid var(--gb); border-radius: 22px;
      padding: 36px 28px; backdrop-filter: blur(20px); -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(20px);
      position: relative; transition: all 0.3s;
    }
    .plan:hover { border-color: rgba(139,92,246,0.3); transform: translateY(-2px); }
    .plan.featured {
      border-color: rgba(139,92,246,0.4);
      background: rgba(139,92,246,0.06);
      box-shadow: 0 0 0 1px rgba(139,92,246,0.15), 0 0 80px rgba(139,92,246,0.06);
    }
    .plan-popular {
      position: absolute; top: -12px; left: 50%; transform: translateX(-50%);
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, #8b5cf6, #6366f1);
      color: #fff; padding: 4px 18px; border-radius: 20px;
      font-size: 11px; font-weight: 700; white-space: nowrap; letter-spacing: 0.3px;
    }
    .plan-tier {
      font-size: 10px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 1.2px; text-transform: uppercase;
      color: var(--t3); margin-bottom: 16px;
    }
    .plan-price { display: flex; align-items: flex-end; gap: 4px; margin-bottom: 6px; }
    .plan-price-num {
      font-size: 48px; font-weight: 800; letter-spacing: -2px; line-height: 1;
      color: var(--t);
    }
    .plan.featured .plan-price-num {
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, #c4b5fd, #818cf8);
      -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent; background-clip: text;
    }
    .plan-price-period { font-size: 14px; color: var(--t3); margin-bottom: 8px; font-weight: 500; }
    .plan-desc { font-size: 13px; color: var(--t2); margin-bottom: 28px; padding-bottom: 24px; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--gb); line-height: 1.5; }
    .plan-feats { list-style: none; margin-bottom: 32px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 10px; }
    .plan-feats li { font-size: 13px; color: var(--t2); display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px; }
    .feat-check {
      width: 18px; height: 18px; border-radius: 6px; flex-shrink: 0;
      background: rgba(139,92,246,0.15); border: 1px solid rgba(139,92,246,0.25);
      display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
      font-size: 10px; color: #c4b5fd; font-weight: 700;
    }
    .plan-btn {
      display: block; text-align: center; padding: 12px;
      border-radius: 12px; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 700; text-decoration: none;
      transition: all 0.2s; letter-spacing: -0.2px;
    }
    .plan-btn-outline {
      background: var(--glass); border: 1px solid var(--gb); color: var(--t2);
    }
    .plan-btn-outline:hover { color: var(--t); border-color: rgba(255,255,255,0.15); background: var(--glass-h); }
    .plan-btn-filled {
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, #8b5cf6, #6366f1);
      border: none; color: #fff;
      box-shadow: 0 4px 20px rgba(139,92,246,0.4);
    }
    .plan-btn-filled:hover { box-shadow: 0 8px 32px rgba(139,92,246,0.6); transform: translateY(-1px); }

    /* ── CTA ── */
    .cta-section { padding: 100px 40px; }
    .cta-box {
      max-width: 820px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center;
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(139,92,246,0.12) 0%, rgba(99,102,241,0.08) 100%);
      border: 1px solid rgba(139,92,246,0.25); border-radius: 28px;
      padding: 80px 60px;
      backdrop-filter: blur(30px); -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(30px);
      position: relative; overflow: hidden;
    }
    .cta-box::before {
      content: ''; position: absolute; top: -100px; left: 50%; transform: translateX(-50%);
      width: 400px; height: 400px; border-radius: 50%;
      background: radial-gradient(circle, rgba(139,92,246,0.15) 0%, transparent 70%);
      filter: blur(40px); pointer-events: none;
    }
    .cta-box h2 { font-size: clamp(28px, 4vw, 44px); font-weight: 800; letter-spacing: -1.5px; margin-bottom: 14px; position: relative; }
    .cta-box p { font-size: 16px; color: var(--t2); margin-bottom: 36px; position: relative; }
    .cta-box .btn-hero-primary { position: relative; }

    /* ── FOOTER ── */
    footer {
      padding: 32px 60px; border-top: 1px solid var(--gb);
      display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center;
      position: relative; z-index: 1;
    }
    .footer-brand { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px; }
    .footer-brand span { font-size: 14px; font-weight: 700; color: var(--t); }
    footer p { font-size: 12px; color: var(--t3); }
    .footer-links { display: flex; gap: 24px; }
    .footer-links a { font-size: 13px; color: var(--t2); text-decoration: none; transition: color 0.2s; }
    .footer-links a:hover { color: var(--t); }

    /* ── RESPONSIVE ── */
    @media (max-width: 768px) {
      nav { padding: 0 24px; }
      .nav-links { display: none; }
      .hero h1 { letter-spacing: -1.5px; }
      .steps-grid, .features-grid, .plans { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
      .how, .features-section .inner, .pricing-section .inner { padding: 60px 24px; }
      .proof-bar { padding: 0 24px 60px; }
      .cta-box { padding: 48px 28px; }
      footer { flex-direction: column; gap: 16px; text-align: center; padding: 24px; }
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>

  <div class="orb orb-1"></div>
  <div class="orb orb-2"></div>
  <div class="orb orb-3"></div>

  <!-- NAV -->
  <nav>
    <a href="/" class="nav-brand">
      <div class="nav-mark">🤖</div>
      <span class="nav-name">ReservasBot</span>
    </a>
    <div class="nav-links">
      <a href="#como-funciona">Cómo funciona</a>
      <a href="#funcionalidades">Funcionalidades</a>
      <a href="#precios">Precios</a>
    </div>
    <div class="nav-actions">
      <a href="/login" class="btn-ghost-sm">Iniciar sesión</a>
      <a href="/registro" class="btn-accent-sm">Empieza gratis</a>
    </div>
  </nav>

  <!-- HERO -->
  <section class="hero">
    <div class="hero-badge">
      <div class="hero-badge-dot"></div>
      Inteligencia artificial para hostelería
    </div>
    <h1>Tu restaurante nunca más<br><em>perderá una reserva</em></h1>
    <p class="hero-sub">ReservasBot atiende llamadas y WhatsApp automáticamente, 24 horas al día. Con voz natural, sin errores, sin pausas.</p>
    <div class="hero-btns">
      <a href="/registro" class="btn-hero-primary">Empieza gratis →</a>
      <a href="#como-funciona" class="btn-hero-secondary">Ver cómo funciona</a>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- STATS -->
  <div class="proof-bar">
    <div class="proof-stat">
      <div class="proof-num">24/7</div>
      <div class="proof-lbl">Siempre disponible</div>
    </div>
    <div class="proof-stat">
      <div class="proof-num">&lt;2s</div>
      <div class="proof-lbl">Tiempo de respuesta</div>
    </div>
    <div class="proof-stat">
      <div class="proof-num">100%</div>
      <div class="proof-lbl">Llamadas atendidas</div>
    </div>
    <div class="proof-stat">
      <div class="proof-num">0€</div>
      <div class="proof-lbl">Para empezar</div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- COMO FUNCIONA -->
  <section id="como-funciona">
    <div class="how">
      <div class="section-tag">Cómo funciona</div>
      <div class="section-title">Simple para ti,<br><em>invisible para tus clientes</em></div>
      <p class="section-sub">En 3 pasos tu restaurante empieza a gestionar reservas automáticamente.</p>
      <div class="steps-grid">
        <div class="step-card">
          <div class="step-num">1</div>
          <div class="step-title">Cliente llama o escribe</div>
          <p class="step-desc">El cliente llama al teléfono de tu restaurante o escribe por WhatsApp para hacer, cancelar o modificar una reserva.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="step-card">
          <div class="step-num">2</div>
          <div class="step-title">El bot gestiona todo</div>
          <p class="step-desc">Laura, tu asistente con voz natural, atiende al cliente, recoge los datos y comprueba disponibilidad en tiempo real.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="step-card">
          <div class="step-num">3</div>
          <div class="step-title">Tú lo ves en el panel</div>
          <p class="step-desc">La reserva aparece en tu panel al instante y recibes un email de confirmación. Sin esfuerzo de tu parte.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- FUNCIONALIDADES -->
  <section id="funcionalidades" class="features-section">
    <div class="inner">
      <div class="section-tag">Funcionalidades</div>
      <div class="section-title">Todo lo que necesita<br><em>tu restaurante</em></div>
      <p class="section-sub">Una plataforma completa. Sin necesidad de nada más.</p>
      <div class="features-grid">
        <div class="feat-card">
          <div class="feat-icon">📞</div>
          <div class="feat-title">Llamadas automáticas</div>
          <p class="feat-desc">Atiende todas las llamadas con voz natural en español. Nunca más una llamada sin respuesta.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="feat-card">
          <div class="feat-icon">💬</div>
          <div class="feat-title">WhatsApp integrado</div>
          <p class="feat-desc">Gestiona reservas por WhatsApp automáticamente. Los clientes pueden reservar, cancelar y modificar.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="feat-card">
          <div class="feat-icon">📊</div>
          <div class="feat-title">Panel en tiempo real</div>
          <p class="feat-desc">Ve todas tus reservas en un panel limpio. Filtra por fecha, busca por nombre y exporta a CSV.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="feat-card">
          <div class="feat-icon">✉️</div>
          <div class="feat-title">Emails automáticos</div>
          <p class="feat-desc">Recibe confirmación por email de cada reserva nueva. Y tus clientes también la reciben.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="feat-card">
          <div class="feat-icon">🔔</div>
          <div class="feat-title">Recordatorios</div>
          <p class="feat-desc">El sistema avisa a tus clientes el día anterior para reducir los no-shows drásticamente.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="feat-card">
          <div class="feat-icon">🪑</div>
          <div class="feat-title">Control de mesas</div>
          <p class="feat-desc">El bot comprueba disponibilidad en tiempo real y nunca acepta más reservas de las que puedes atender.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- PRICING -->
  <section id="precios" class="pricing-section">
    <div class="inner">
      <div style="text-align:center;">
        <div class="section-tag">Precios</div>
        <div class="section-title">Precios claros,<br><em>sin sorpresas</em></div>
        <p class="section-sub" style="margin:0 auto;">Primer mes gratis. Cancela cuando quieras. Sin tarjeta de crédito para empezar.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="plans">
        <div class="plan">
          <div class="plan-tier">Básico</div>
          <div class="plan-price">
            <div class="plan-price-num">49€</div>
            <div class="plan-price-period">/mes</div>
          </div>
